{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「遊戲王 Master Duel 高中生日本第一決定戰 2026」決賽大會現場報導！專訪奪冠的沖繩隊伍「刹徒業貪」\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6829979ce76ba19722ba703f0edab9c05008d8ed15e8c77c8140f5344e39385b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb815e2f59ee4c5566e7529b5fa9b2249.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「遊戲王 Master Duel 高中生日本第一決定戰 2026」決賽大會現場報導！專訪奪冠的沖繩隊伍「刹徒業貪」</figcaption></figure><p>KONAMI數位娛樂旗下數位卡牌遊戲「<strong>遊戲王 Master Duel</strong>」選拔高中生日本第一的官方大賽「<strong>遊戲王 Master Duel 高中生日本第一決定戰 2026</strong>」<br/>決賽大會於2026年11月15日(日)在東京有明的「Konami Creative Front Tokyo Bay」舉行，Saiga NAK也來到了現場！</p><h2>「遊戲王 Master Duel 高中生日本第一決定戰 2026」決賽大會登場！</h2><figure><img alt=\"Konami Creative Front Tokyo Bay\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fb26945ad8d594d90fced81803de6548149cef3cc414a98cb00bf0d09a97fdce/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbc77f67060ea5131501b0f7e350102b9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>比賽會場Konami Creative Front Tokyo Bay</figcaption></figure><p>本大賽由居住在日本國內的高中生、夜間部高中生、高等專門學校學生及函授高中生參加，以<strong>2人1隊的團體戰</strong>角逐日本第一。</p><p></p><figure><img alt=\"晉級決賽的選手們\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c690902ec9c7ebd3419ef0acc1c90a26cdc359d42ea361e117afc4dab620d16e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F11a5ea75b20763c8d68b7ca59136c4b9.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>晉級決賽的精銳好手們</figcaption></figure><p>晉級決賽的是突破線上預賽的<strong>8隊共16人</strong>。<br/>所有選手都穿著學校制服上場，這也是高中生大賽才看得到的光景。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><img alt=\"直播舞台(正面)\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/223bb0250ad9a913a8b68922d829df0b5b1c5127756738f740af50b2add0844b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8306eab6faa5ffa68ea7684fec71b047.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>冠軍戰將在這座直播舞台上演</figcaption></figure><p>決戰舞台上，閃耀著翡翠綠光芒的巨大螢幕令人印象深刻。<br/>藍色與紅色燈光交錯的昏暗場內浮現出綠光，連在一旁觀看的我們都感受到了緊張氣氛。</p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0596d5194c5c69ef49b123dab193e016324c5e0a196072b59ca452fdf12361d2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7eb2ec6133f85ff043daaa9d74c45757.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f86adbba2d4bd37daefa5d54ddbe78a57f195f0fa25cf9e37d61e4cc1e25fb1f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe1b18bdf189332cf8ed3e74177b79a3c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-07.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2d33890bee1979892be7e3573244d20fb88b498009e46af49b800a04d4304063/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd97bf6f4c84a26a5f17c160421541eba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-08.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e266f605662fe6f380b19fee9e326ccbf393cb4f7d7e2bafe28cc7f2897b1621/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb3e04a2d8959058657ad2bf8684ed771.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>會場內也設置了武藤遊戲等系列角色的看板。<br/>在歷代主角的注視下，戰鬥終於揭開序幕。</p><h3>決賽大會開幕</h3><p>決賽大會分為2個階段進行。<br/>第一階段將參賽隊伍分成2組進行循環賽。<br/>各組前2名的隊伍晉級第二階段。</p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-09.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/102dafe3e1e5bc201f6c488586f0822cc48aaa7631afc81e8895b9106222c45c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Faba7a55d769439ebd262da2df204fc8b.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-10.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1c0d5530a6d7480e368c21a6013c508379e4c5a485e0a682ae71ed1421893308/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd5d947bab146825312e3152e64a34643.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>和充滿學生朝氣的大合照截然不同，比賽中選手們的神情無比認真。<br/>每一桌都上演著卡牌遊戲特有的無聲激戰。</p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-11.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ec3b76bcffcaf9ace84678de13e69731ca24b1444438534fea2c900d5195369d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa6e78df93c65509fd63e403b476822b3.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-12.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ed88f842d22a3151f8ff5e4265f1f0fcf36c111909b66959113f3fa108fca31c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe8709f999f4ca3d4be86a2e3e649f604.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>選手們不時和隊友一起盯著畫面討論，絞盡腦汁思考對策。<br/>在激戰中勝出、晉級第二階段的是以下4支隊伍。</p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-13.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/21c8cbb73f7b18cbbc954f04e9d274b0b7dab9c93f8b7dda9a6beb52767cdeb0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2f4c790985050e3c5bd9a6465096df60.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-14.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/af6e7333de5488ca2ea7840303b99b37c12c10aee5988b9042a5e832d0c5882c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8c2c789e8852ef29705670353e0d984f.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-15.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/234e57b9a9293c2cd086de070feeb5e07eea60d44da1c18fdb2232fcd483f146/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcf60b1972e4250182cc4611524cb2892.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-16.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/51050a5a1d13a94e5ecc512f71d2b72784cf54baf23f3d77009ad2251e36757a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd9ed56f371431b4ac629e431a85dcaad.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>每支隊伍都神情自信，散發著高手的氣場。</p><h4>第二階段</h4><p>第二階段採淘汰賽制，在2場準決賽中勝出的2支隊伍將晉級冠軍戰。</p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-17.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c6ff58a854d7795e4f9121e0f15fa9112e36f62c6c89e6aeb9e4a972a22cd3db/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8f0c74c454838968bd52f5fb92d7faa9.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-18.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/838152848d88787646166a16b63e6193b45205237fcff4077105b1944b407db6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6321b572897ff49a2aebf7b807e25d03.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><figure><img alt=\"欣喜若狂的「卡是撿來的」隊\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e20aa2af9dace3fe8a31a9923b03056048f76d4c4f6f189fa2ae83438d1338f8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa27de182858ab84f55d6be16127f79f6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>欣喜若狂的Hiroru選手(左)與Yasaku選手(右)</figcaption></figure><p>第二階段第1場比賽由「卡是撿來的」隊對上「Egg Planter」隊。<br/>這場由「卡是撿來的」隊勝出，晉級冠軍戰。<br/>尤其Yasaku選手在本屆大賽中拿下熱門主題「星宿」的內戰，充分展現了實力。</p><figure><img alt=\"「刹徒業貪」隊的致勝一擊\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/38c1cc19cd694a7722c40e7475ceeaacb0d2fde57ab8d2ed7a28fe9b68ddd08b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2910999ca979f03197e2cbcbc0109ae8.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>鬆了一口氣、相擁在一起的「刹徒業貪」隊兩人</figcaption></figure><p>接下來的第2場比賽由「Ostracoda」隊對上「刹徒業貪」隊。<br/>這場由「刹徒業貪」隊勝出，晉級冠軍戰。</p><figure><img alt=\"仰天長嘆的法魅那選手\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/941629fc88e8365c0eaf14be481fda8779d89d0172364f07eddcb6669a45b2a2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7dcd28bed5b6c8bb7891c4f656305ae6.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>直播畫面也清楚拍到法魅那選手仰天長嘆的瞬間</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"激動的握拳\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/486fcdb33b56b50ff468f27235e8524ff2b66c3348adb982354c915b70c70095/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6eb72f59d77aea78ce2f22f739fb8899.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>激動的握拳歡呼</figcaption></figure><p>法魅那選手在比賽中一度仰天長嘆，但隨後逆轉勝出，忍不住握拳歡呼。</p><h4>冠軍戰</h4><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-24.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/38e32033dcd948abb22d0f83b835de4183d09b2ec8ab837ff95cc915272902f1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F43bb0bada132ad167297c6c4f998c6dd.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-25.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/93ff02af67dffd9633254e2e3ba39b9b69ac23ba4ecd2008e5c562c27e393d45/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F748a1996230bd28ec648ecbd44af2abf.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>終於來到「卡是撿來的」隊與「刹徒業貪」隊的冠軍戰。<br/>先拿下2勝的隊伍將成為日本第一。<br/>「卡是撿來的」隊的Hiroru選手帶的是非主流牌組。<br/>另一方的「刹徒業貪」隊則是隊內共用相同的牌組主題，以團體戰特有的團結力應戰。</p><figure><img alt=\"法魅那選手的先攻\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e0cb976dd178b4892b7c9687f32d624b653885266264a08c21f110a081397366/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F11fa688b39812fead0e76507eeb2178c.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>先攻就擺出3隻怪獸！</figcaption></figure><p>首先是選用「炎王蛇眼」的Hiroru選手，對上選用「烙印＋星宿」的法魅那選手。<br/>取得先攻的法魅那選手一口氣鋪好場面。</p><figure><img alt=\"無限泡影\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ca688124aaf7245f21e87853b752b49f4087a7c73e2e99a72231a0849daa7a4c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb2ad3600ccf6ccef8c23bd20bf962dc7.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>玩家再熟悉不過的「無限泡影」</figcaption></figure><p>下一回合，Hiroru選手刻意沒在對手回合使用原本可以發動的干擾卡，而是留到這時才發動，試圖拆掉對手的場面。<br/>之後雙方展開激烈的干擾卡攻防，最後率先耗盡資源的Hiroru選手無法突破場面，只能結束回合。</p><figure><img alt=\"法魅那選手的致勝一擊\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/930d135674d4c8509de44fc88f40c8bdf8b459d79b83f4de2cdf400aedc2bff0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1a20eb7f3778bb48e0fc3521c78c0459.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>法魅那選手的致勝一擊</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鬆了一口氣的表情\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5f382f407d37f8a46614fa1374588f88d7d9b246e13780bfefaac21d83d5a850/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4bfc565c8c4bad844e7fca9b7100d086.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>法魅那選手露出鬆了一口氣的表情</figcaption></figure><p>接著在下一回合，法魅那選手在場上排出更多怪獸發動總攻擊，拿下第1戰。<br/>到此為止個人戰績保持全勝的法魅那選手，也將全勝紀錄維持到了最後。</p><figure><img alt=\"紀念盾\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/84f4c3ad0ede716016f7c40389da7bfae73fffe321504709ff1397af38018e59/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F085a66019d38bd1574ae0a29d1389a38.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>冠軍究竟會是哪一隊呢？</figcaption></figure><p>接下來第2戰是Yasaku選手對上鯛魚燒選手。<br/>兩人都選用「烙印＋星宿」，打成星宿內戰。</p><figure><img alt=\"Yasaku選手的先攻\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b4b59aae461ca7ab4eeff74885623a0526eb6d2fc588767183bd1684014b180d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F91b27677a24bd0f48ee6540e1b7255de.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>一開場就不惜付出LP也要展開怪獸</figcaption></figure><p>由Yasaku選手先攻。<br/>雖然吃了好幾張干擾卡，仍成功鋪出足以給對手施壓的場面。</p><figure><img alt=\"增殖的G\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0b0b3160a69fcf2b99069cd8b31b9f9227bedee004111bb042a7152b8d2da870/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F796248157eb0bf3fb2ecc49a9ee37050.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>發動「增殖的G」！</figcaption></figure><p>下一回合，就在鯛魚燒選手準備開始展開時，Yasaku選手發動了「增殖的G」。<br/>「增殖的G」能在對手每次特殊召喚怪獸時抽1張牌，Yasaku選手藉此牽制鯛魚燒選手。</p><figure><img alt=\"強行突破作戰\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5926abfede9ff32a2a1c84f98c7f14dda286b251306a38da8ebf8c50dea0f56a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe2b4a6bcbe3ba60b8a0414d40318b0ef.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>那就別讓對手有反擊的機會！</figcaption></figure><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-34.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a120ca608331429eaf6732c1df803fbfd781f86849eca9af5b53d7bfbf743277/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff9ae9b4811eb1c577f9aea58ff97a335.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-35.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1a66ce3f7350a7a41e18e5b88cde1b342e01682b6bea480a9a7ea7bf3b513835/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4d8c70e0d35052a2232c6a2bfe494d44.png\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>對此，鯛魚燒選手決定硬吃G，改採強行突破，力拚在這回合分出勝負。<br/>一路闖過Yasaku選手的重重干擾，大量展開怪獸並一口氣打出總攻擊。<br/>把對手的LP打到歸零，為「刹徒業貪」隊拿下勝利！<br/>「刹徒業貪」隊以2比0奪冠。<br/>來自沖繩的2人，登上了高中生日本第一的寶座！</p><figure><img alt=\"緊緊握手\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3a5200e4dd962c00ca8ad48cc4a135d034bfdeac8a8328388094fec4187d538f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffa91380e82f8eda2a6295e44c29aeec7.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>不論勝負都以笑容收場</figcaption></figure><p>賽後兩位選手緊緊握手，兩隊臉上都沒有一絲遺憾。<br/>這場精彩的決鬥，也讓在場觀戰的我們看得十分痛快。</p><figure><img alt=\"紀念盾\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/29131363dae78c7b9557ca7bb71834fbe1e3d6f6f8669a0288596812e57fc801/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4b5e0aa45069f119a9d7739502476b30.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>閃閃發亮的紀念盾</figcaption></figure><p>奪冠的「刹徒業貪」隊2人各獲頒一座紀念盾。<br/>恭喜兩位！<br/>兩人賽後也接受了我們的專訪。</p><h4>賽後專訪</h4><figure><img alt=\"「刹徒業貪」隊\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9e4bb9f3f5c7a6a0fa1185d4e392c4025c4391bf2444abd8143e0cadbf5d5a51/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff994d5236ae82c1a1bc5f7fdf82aee70.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「刹徒業貪」隊的鯛魚燒選手(左)與法魅那選手(右)</figcaption></figure><h5>― 請分享奪冠後最直接的感想</h5><p><strong>鯛魚燒選手</strong>: 第一個浮現的念頭就是「好開心」。<br/>這次之所以沒那麼緊張，是因為沖繩的夥伴和朋友們幫我畫插圖、做應援扇為我加油，把他們的心意託付給了我。<br/>我從大家身上得到了很多勇氣。</p><p><strong>法魅那選手</strong>: 果然還是很開心。<br/>能帶鯛魚燒前輩登上日本第一的寶座，再加上和前輩、夥伴們一起調整牌組和練習的成果終於開花結果，真的讓我非常高興。</p><h5>― 剛才提到調整牌組，你們大概花了多久時間備賽呢？</h5><p><strong>鯛魚燒選手</strong>: 從線上預賽開始算的話，大概是從今年8月底起，每3天練1次左右。<br/>都是晚上開著通話一起練的。</p><h5>― 請告訴我們這次大賽選用這些牌組的用意</h5><p><strong>鯛魚燒選手</strong>: 我使用的第1副牌組是「耀聖＋殺手旋律」。<br/>這副牌組在取得先攻時的鋪場能力非常強。<br/>所以我把它用在不想給對手任何逆轉機會的「關鍵時刻」。<br/>第2副是「烙印＋星宿」。<br/>這副可以塞進大量先攻後攻都好用的強力泛用卡，所以和第1副完全不同，我是在需要應付各種對手牌組時派它上場。<br/>法魅那選手也使用了同樣的2副牌組，不過出場順序剛好相反。</p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-40.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1452\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5bc6d3181080c659336821ae5dbeffc067db9ecd3420278adf23e6c2abe2bee7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fce2661b4b4c7bac913ebc52144948698.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-41.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1467\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3d32d462d09148a12cd2cb66a2c7068f86c056811711f236015081cb619e7776/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F92e7eef7f7ac45036d48ef42d36e3c7f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-42.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e198e15ef698ce8447b618c0691fc43bd271725bd0ecca0accf17d7103c8775d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdc716a5de78cd5b5d08af9ee6be3536c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/yugioh-masterduel-high-school-championship2026-report-43.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1463\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dfb7a528d5fbbba9b7bc45de75f7048c6974b900f3b2e25438e654d2cde04785/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F696b0cbfe3e54997a7ea4c22c2bb07ac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><h5>― 請告訴我們你們最喜歡的卡片。</h5><p><strong>鯛魚燒選手</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.db.yugioh-card.com/yugiohdb/card_search.action?ope=2&amp;cid=20786&amp;request_locale=ja\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「無光之影 阿寶阿庫」</a>吧。<br/>理由很單純，因為很可愛(笑)</p><p><strong>法魅那選手</strong>: 我的話，看我的玩家名稱就知道了，當然是<a href=\"https://www.db.yugioh-card.com/yugiohdb/card_search.action?ope=2&amp;cid=21355&amp;request_locale=ja\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「星宿炮手 法魅那」</a>。<br/>除了卡圖很美、強度很高之外，我本來就很喜歡「星宿」這個主題，法魅那救了我好幾次，是一路並肩作戰的卡片，所以我對它很有感情。</p><figure><img alt=\"星宿炮手 法魅那\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ad711936429118f2a1275a95e5474d05481605da364ed0845cd2330fdd844f64/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff3d5d4dc4fb37566c1928b5926960014.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「星宿炮手 法魅那」在本屆大賽中也大顯身手</figcaption></figure><h5>― 你們應該也即將面臨升學和考試，今後還打算繼續玩遊戲王嗎？</h5><p><strong>鯛魚燒選手</strong>: 準備考試的期間應該會暫時停玩，但我想就算上了大學或出了社會，還是會繼續玩遊戲王。<br/>以世界標準來看，我覺得自己的實力還遠遠不夠，但希望總有一天能打進世界大賽。</p><p><strong>法魅那選手</strong>: 我希望以這次奪冠為契機，在朋友之間推廣遊戲王，讓大家玩得更開心。</p><p>本屆大賽可在<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gvRFLU6DXvU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">遊戲王OCG頻道</a>觀看直播存檔。<br/>限時公開至2027年2月14日(日)23:59為止，有興趣的讀者千萬別錯過。<br/>以上就是「遊戲王 Master Duel 高中生日本第一決定戰 2026」決賽現場報導！</p><blockquote><p></p><p>⚔━━━━━━━━━━━<a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E9%81%8A%E6%88%AF%E7%8E%8B%E3%83%9E%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%87%E3%83%A5%E3%82%A8%E3%83%AB?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#遊戯王マスターデュエル</a><br/>高校生日本一決定戦2026<br/>　　　全日程終了！<br/>━━━━━━━━━━━⚔<a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/%E3%83%9E%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%87%E3%83%A5%E3%82%A8%E3%83%AB%E9%AB%98%E6%A0%A1%E7%94%9F%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%9A?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#マスターデュエル高校生大会</a> に参加いただいた高校生の皆さま、配信をご視聴いただいた皆さま、本当にありがとうございました！… <a href=\"https://t.co/zBqEGwhJjp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/zBqEGwhJjp</a></p><p>— 【公式】 遊戯王 マスターデュエル (@YuGiOh_MD_INFO) <a href=\"https://x.com/YuGiOh_MD_INFO/status/2121906057018830997?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 15, 2026</a></p></blockquote><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/tokyoesportsfesta-2027-ambassador-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「東京電競嘉年華2027」官方大使連續兩年由 StanMi Japan 擔任！競賽項目新增「快打6」</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/pawaspi-gold-t-point/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「職棒野球魂・點數俱樂部」對應V點數！可用於交換遊戲內道具或付款</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/castlevania-belmonts-curse/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《惡魔城：貝爾蒙特的詛咒》於 10 月 15 日發售！親筆簽名海報、電競電腦等好禮抽獎活動同步登場</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/review/tgs2026-yugioh-tagforcegx-hands-on/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸【TGS2026】試玩《遊戲王 TAG FORCE GX》！享受更加舒適的決鬥學園生活吧！</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/genso-museum-tokyo-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「系列30週年紀念 幻想水滸傳I&amp;II展 FINAL 〜幻想博物館〜(東京凱旋)」決定於東京巨蛋城舉辦！自2027年5月22日起</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.877727+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3272,"images":42,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:52.732269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:40.458064+00:00","content_hash":"e63f26edb3828e9412c7d49fc437f825c579b2c9dd0fc9437d8c022a43bcc2e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}